      "leaf_id": "K07.long_rest_hp_exhaustion_duration",
      "family": "state",
      "source_ref": {
        "pdf_page": 369,
        "printed_page": 370,
        "text": "Long Rest (Rules Glossary): at least 8 hours; needs at least 1 Hit Point to start; regain all lost HP; Exhaustion level decreases by 1; not possible during combat (rolling Initiative interrupts). Engine note: the 0 HP refusal comes from the generic require_player_can_act guard (not a Long Rest rule); the combat refusal is an interpretation of rolling Initiative interrupting a rest",
        "verified_from": "page scan image"
      },
